Sumantra begins Durvāsas word at urging --- Durvāsas winters at Vasiṣṭha holy ashram --- Daśaratha visits and asks lineage future --- Durvāsas foretells Rāma long happy reign --- Durvāsas foretells coming kin partings --- Rāma offers horse rites founds lines gains Brahmalōka --- Daśaratha salutes sages and returns home --- Lakṣmaṇa rejoices and pair nights on Gōmatī